            228.47,
            73.29,
            241.95
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": true,
          "fonts": [
            "ArialMT",
            "SymbolMT"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            11.04
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Providing catch-up vaccination for those who have missed doses can have a major impact on closing",
          "bbox": [
            83.06,
            231.29,
            532.31,
            242.33
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": true,
          "fonts": [
            "Calibri"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            11.04
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "immunization gaps that would otherwise compound as populations increase in age.  As these",
          "bbox": [
            83.06,
            246.05,
            501.66,
            257.09
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": true,
          "fonts": [
            "Calibri"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            11.04
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "individuals age, it becomes harder to identify effective ways to reach them with the needed",
          "bbox": [
